OL,3,APakistani man sentenced to 27 years for
OL,4,AIran-backed plot to kill Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Pakistani man with ties to Iran's
OL,7,Fgovernment has been sentenced to 27
OL,8,Fyears in prison for his role in a plot
OL,9,Fto assassinate US President Donald
OL,10,FTrump and other officials.
OL,12,FAsif Merchant was found guilty in March
OL,13,Fof attempting to commit an act of
OL,14,Fterrorism transcending national
OL,15,Fboundaries and murder for hire after
OL,16,Ftrying to hire hitmen to kill Trump,
OL,17,Fformer President Joe Biden, and former
OL,18,FUS ambassador to the United Nations
OL,19,FNikki Haley.
OL,21,FThe hitmen were instead undercover FBI
OL,22,Fagents.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
