OL,7,Fthe direction of Iran's Islamic
OL,8,FRevolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC) to
OL,9,Favenge the 2020 US assassination of
OL,10,FQasem Soleimani, Iran's topmost
OL,11,Fmilitary commander.
